# 🏢 Company Profile: Apex Logistics Solutions

> **Note:** This company profile is a **fictional scenario** created strictly for practical GRC study, risk assessments, and portfolio demonstration purposes.

---

## 📌 Overview
* **Industry:** Third-Party Logistics (3PL) & Supply Chain Management
* **Business Model:** Regional logistics provider managing warehousing, inventory fulfillment, and local last-mile deliveries for small-to-medium e-commerce brands.
* **Headcount:** 120 employees across 3 physical locations (1 Corporate Office, 2 Operational Warehouses).

---

## 💻 Technology Footprint & Environment

* **Client Web Portal (Public-Facing):** Web-based portal used by e-commerce clients to track orders, manage shipments, and view real-time delivery status.
* **Inventory Management System (Cloud):** SaaS-based software managing real-time stock levels, warehouse locations, and order processing.
* **Warehouse Operational Network (On-Premise):** Local wireless and wired network infrastructure powering hand-held barcode scanners, label printers, and local workstation terminals across both warehouses.

---

## 🎯 GRC Assessment Scope
This profile serves as the baseline target organization for evaluating cybersecurity risk, internal control gaps, and compliance posture against the **NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) 2.0**.
